## Fase 2 — Backend por entorno (`terraform/envs/*/backend.tf`)

### Opción A — bucket compartido rag-agents (config actual)

**`terraform/envs/dev/backend.tf`**

```hcl
terraform {
  backend "s3" {
    bucket         = "rag-agents-terraform-state-615216531593"
    key            = "bulkrag/ecs-extractor/dev/terraform.tfstate"
    region         = "us-east-1"
    dynamodb_table = "rag-agents-terraform-locks"
    encrypt        = true
  }
}
```

**`terraform/envs/prod/backend.tf`**

```hcl
terraform {
  backend "s3" {
    bucket         = "rag-agents-terraform-state-615216531593"
    key            = "bulkrag/ecs-extractor/prod/terraform.tfstate"
