### Opción B — bucket dedicado (post-bootstrap)

Reemplazar `bucket` y `dynamodb_table` con los outputs de `terraform/bootstrap`:

```hcl
bucket         = "bulkrag-terraform-state-615216531593"
dynamodb_table = "bulkrag-terraform-locks"
key            = "ecs-extractor/dev/terraform.tfstate"   # o prod
```

