## Troubleshooting

| Error | Causa | Solución |
|-------|-------|----------|
| `Error loading state: AccessDenied` | Rol/usuario sin permiso S3 | Agregar statement en OIDC policy o IAM user |
| `Error acquiring state lock` | Lock huérfano tras crash | `terraform force-unlock LOCK_ID` (con cuidado) |
| `Backend configuration changed` | Cambio de bucket/key | `terraform init -reconfigure` o `-migrate-state` |
| `Bucket already exists` | Bootstrap duplicado | Usar Opción A o importar bucket existente |
| `ConditionalCheckFailedException` | Dos applies simultáneos | Normal; esperar que termine el otro job |

